### 단축 URL 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten-urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.naver.com",
  "channel": "instagram"
}

> {% client.global.set("key", response.body.shortenUrlKey); %}

### 리다이렉트 (방금 만든 키 사용)
GET http://localhost:8080/{{key}}

### 정보 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shorten-urls/{{key}}

### 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shorten-urls?originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.naver.com

### 잘못된 URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten-urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "javascript:alert(1)",
  "channel": "instagram"
}